==== Serial ====

The Board has a 2*7 pin card edge connector behind the power connector, the Serial Port works with 3,3v Voltage @57600 bauds

| A1   | UART RX   |
| B1   | UART TX   |
| B3   | GND       |

A is the bottom side

B is the upper side

